		"!ParentKey": "#BaseTitlePage",
		"#ObjDetails": {
			"Description": "@@#Color:Red:Squirrels@@ are radical political extremist devoted to the @@#Color:Blue:New Squorld Order@@\n\nThese small and squirrely (they hate that term) critters are highly aggressive. While they may be lacking in @@#Stat:Health@@ and @@#Stat:PhyAttack@@, they have high @@#Stat:Speed@@ and just enough @@#Stat:Evasion@@ to be annoying.\n\nOften attacking in large swarms, the @@#Color:Blue:NSO@@ has committed countless acts of terrorism on defenseless @@#Color:Red:Abandoned Villages@@. So don't feel bad about killing them.",
